<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:py-16 lg:px-8">
  <article class="prose lg:prose-xl max-w-none">
    <h2>Join us</h2>
    <p>Membership of THENCF is free and all are welcome to join.</p>
    
    <h3>Join as a Member</h3>
    <p>You can join as a member without paying a contribution:</p>
    
    <form name="join" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" data-netlify-recaptcha="true" action="/thanks.html" class="not-prose my-8">
      <p class="hidden">
        <label>
          Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field" />
        </label>
      </p>
      
      <div class="mb-6">
        <label for="name" class="block mb-2 font-medium">Name</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-2 border-2 border-purple-600 rounded text-pink-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500">
      </div>
      
      <div class="mb-6">
        <label for="email" class="block mb-2 font-medium">Email</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-2 border-2 border-purple-600 rounded text-pink-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500">
      </div>
      
      <div data-netlify-recaptcha="true" class="mb-6"></div>
      
      <button type="submit" class="inline-block px-6 py-2 border-2 border-purple-600 text-purple-600 font-medium text-xs leading-tight uppercase rounded hover:bg-black hover:bg-opacity-5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 transition duration-150 ease-in-out">
        Join
      </button>
    </form>
    
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Your name and email are used for our mailing list and one-to-one member communication only. No other data is collected. This site has no cookies or third-party trackers.</p>
    
    <hr class="my-12">

    <h3>Become a full member</h3>
    <p>You can become a full member by paying an Annual contribution to help fund the cooperative. This gives you voting rights at the AGM and the ability to book the NCF space for your event.</p>
        
      <h4 class="mt-4 mb-2">Annual Membership Prices</h4>
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li><strong>Full membership:</strong> €20</li>
        <li><strong>Student/OAP/Unwaged:</strong> €10</li>
        <li><strong>Under 18:</strong> €5</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Note for those unable to pay a contribution, you may also volunteer your time in lieu of payment.</p>
    </div>
    
    <h3>Payment Methods</h3>
    
    <div class="not-prose grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 my-6">
      <div class="p-6 border-2 border-purple-600 rounded-lg">
        <h4 class="mt-0 mb-3 text-xl">Online Payment</h4>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm">Pay securely online via SumUp</p>
        <a href="https://pay.sumup.com/b2c/QA6YMFPH" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block px-6 py-2 border-2 border-purple-600 text-purple-600 font-medium text-xs leading-tight uppercase rounded hover:bg-black hover:bg-opacity-5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 transition duration-150 ease-in-out">
          Pay via SumUp
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 border-2 border-purple-600 rounded-lg">
        <h4 class="mt-0 mb-3 text-xl">Bank Transfer</h4>
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm">Transfer directly to our account</p>
        <div class="text-sm space-y-1 font-mono">
          <p><strong>IBAN:</strong><br>IE41SUMU99036510863306</p>
          <p><strong>BIC:</strong> SUMUIE22XXX</p>
          <p><strong>Account:</strong> THENCF cultural cooperative</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-gray-600">Please include your name and "Membership 2026" in the transfer reference.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 border-2 border-purple-600 rounded-lg">
        <h4 class="mt-0 mb-3 text-xl">Cash</h4>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm">Pay in person with cash</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Please contact us to arrange payment in person.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
